p 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/80px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Quickened_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\">Metamagic: Quickened Spell</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/40px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/60px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/80px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/40px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\">Gather Your Allies (class action)</a></span>\n</p><p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>By gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a> as an ally, during <a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gather Your Allies\">Gather Your Allies</a>.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When summoned, Mizora quips: <i>\"I thought you'd never ask.\"</i></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063236\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.121 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.125 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5753/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 98731/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 40590/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 987/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1562032/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n158.06%  155.178     59 Template:Trim\n100.00%   98.179      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   98.179      1 -total\n 27.43%   26.926     17 Template:Icon_text\n 25.44%   24.979     15 Template:SAI\n 25.04%   24.584     16 Template:Icon_link\n 13.93%   13.676      1 Template:Creature\n 12.19%   11.966      5 Template:Template_style\n 10.04%    9.859      1 Template:Creature/format\n  9.46%    9.289      1 Template:AttributeBlock\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:24434-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715063236 and revision id 375691. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}